50,3,1,talk,Shizue,,The Path Network seems risky due to weather and the older blocks' hazards. I prefer the Study Commons.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,3,1,talk,Yumi,,The Study Commons is perfect! It solves the booking crisis and provides the general space students need.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,3,1,talk,George,,The Laboratory Ventilation Upgrade is the only one that relieves the technicians' manual burden.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,3,1,talk,Mizuki,,The Media Center is too specialist. The Study Commons aligns with the highest post-occupancy ratings.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,3,1,talk,Benjamin,,"The Media Center lacks a renewal reserve. The Study Commons is a safer, more sustainable investment.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
55,3,2,talk,Shizue,,"@George, I feel for the technicians, but the Commons seems less likely to slip its schedule.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
56,3,2,talk,Yumi,,"@George, could the technicians help with the Commons? Or is the lab really that bad?","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
57,3,2,talk,George,,"The lab is a matter of daily efficiency. However, I see the logic regarding the budget.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
58,3,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Benjamin, do you think the Commons avoids the mechanical cost spikes you mentioned?","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
59,3,2,talk,Benjamin,,"Yes, a conversion of a hall is far less volatile than a full ventilation overhaul.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
60,3,3,talk,Shizue,,I am quite happy with the Study Commons. It is a gentle improvement for everyone.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,3,talk,Yumi,,I'm voting for the Commons! It's the most energetic choice for the students.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,3,talk,George,,"I still lean toward the labs, but I cannot ignore the staffing and budget warnings.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,3,talk,Mizuki,,The evidence for the Study Commons is the most consistent across our findings.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,3,talk,Benjamin,,It is the most rational choice. It minimizes risk and maximizes utility.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,4,talk,Shizue,,Then we are mostly in agreement.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,4,talk,Yumi,,Yay!,"{""words"":1,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,4,talk,George,,I will concede to the majority for the sake of the budget.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,4,talk,Mizuki,,Let us vote.,"{""words"":3,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,4,talk,Benjamin,,Agreed.,"{""words"":1,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
